    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"superior tolerability\" angle sounds good, but we need to be careful. I was looking at the internal clinical reports and noticed the dizziness rates are actually about 5% higher with CardioZen than the competitor. If a doctor brings that up specifically, what should the reps say to pivot back to our strengths without sounding like they're dodging the question?",
